  "description": "German tennis national coach Yuf Gnabry never expected to be charmed at the Olympics until he met South Korea’s rising star Son Rayeon. After a single practice match with her, Yuf is blown away by her familiar playstyle and her relentless pursuit of his attention. On the court, Rayeon is a prodigy, but off the court, she is a woman with a dangerous desire. One night, Yuf finds Rayeon waiting for him in front of his room with a mischievous smile. Can Yuf resist the rising star who refuses to take no for an answer?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Kingdom Company's Sarangi Kkotpineun Seonsuchon (사랑이 꽃피는 선수촌) Collection.*",
